## Command

```shell
biome format --bracket-same-line true --write file.jsx
```

## `file.jsx`

```jsx
<Foo
	className={style}
	reallyLongAttributeName1={longComplexValue}
	reallyLongAttributeName2={anotherLongValue}
/>;

<Foo
	className={style}
	reallyLongAttributeName1={longComplexValue}
	reallyLongAttributeName2={anotherLongValue}>
	Hi
</Foo>;

```

